<title>USA: USDATA CFO Shipowitz expands duties. [CORRECTED 23:30 GMT]</title>
<headline>USDATA CFO Shipowitz expands duties. [CORRECTED 23:30 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDATA Corp said Thursday its chief financial officer, Jay Shipowitz, had added the title of senior vice president-finance and administration.</p>
<p>(Corrects Shipowitz's new duties)</p>
<p>Shipowitz was named CFO and vice president-finance last July, it said.</p>
<p>USDATA provides computer software to businesses.</p>
